==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[crab-apple]], [[crab apple]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A variety of apple tree that yields bitter, small fruit (in comparison to ordinary apples.)
# The fruit of this tree.
# An unpleasant person; a person who is [[crabby]].

